// FA-09 AI-world behaviour params (FR-PEA-701…704). The AI factions run an
// ABSTRACTED, heuristic, seeded model over composed capability estimates (not a
// mirror of FA-04..08). Capability is clamped to the plausibility envelope (no
// cheating into impossible tech); difficulty tunes funding/competence only.
// Sourced from design/05-WORLD.md §7.
(
    base_competence: 0.45,
    envelope_cap: 1.0,
    tide_advance_per_day: 0.00002,
    claim_threshold: 0.6,
    source: "design/05-WORLD.md §7 (AI world: simplified same systems; same physics/plausibility; difficulty tunes funding/competence)",
)
